# 머리 위 체력바 - 테스트 버전 (플레이어 + 몬스터/동물 등 모든 생명체)
# 주의: 기존 healthbar.sk 와 동시에 켜지 마세요 (기존 파일은 이름을 -healthbar.sk 로 바꿔 비활성화).

options:
	bar-length: 10
	player-bar-height: 0.6   # 플레이어용 높이
	mob-bar-height: 0.3      # 몬스터용 높이 (몹마다 키가 달라서 테스트하며 조절)
	show-percent: false
	mob-hide-full: true      # true: 몹은 체력이 가득 차 있으면 바를 숨김 (맞아서 깎이면 표시)
	mob-radius: 24           # 플레이어 주변 이 거리 안의 몹에만 바를 띄움
	check-interval: 5 ticks
	show-damage: true        # 맞았을 때 데미지 숫자를 띄움
	damage-height: 0.9       # 데미지 숫자가 뜨기 시작하는 높이 (눈 위치 기준)

# id = 엔티티 UUID 문자열
function hpbar_remove(id: string):
	set {_d} to {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%}
	if {_d} is set:
		delete entity within {_d}
	delete {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%}
	delete {-hpbar_key::%{_id}%}

function hpbar_show(e: living entity):
	if {_e} is dead:
		stop

	set {_max} to {_e}'s max health
	set {_hp} to {_e}'s health
	set {_key} to "%{_hp}%/%{_max}%"
	set {_id} to "%uuid of {_e}%"

	# 투명 포션 효과 중인 플레이어는 체력바를 숨긴다(효과가 끝나면 다음 갱신에서 다시 생김). {-invis} 는 potions.sk 가 관리.
	if {_e} is a player:
		if {-invis::%{_id}%} is set:
			if {-invis::%{_id}%} > now:
				if {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%} is set:
					hpbar_remove({_id})
				stop

	# 몹은 체력이 가득 차 있으면 바를 숨김
	if {_e} is not a player:
		if "{@mob-hide-full}" is "true":
			if {_hp} >= {_max}:
				if {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%} is set:
					hpbar_remove({_id})
				stop

	set {_d} to {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%}
	set {_new} to false
	if {_d} is not set:
		set {_new} to true
	else if {_d} is dead:
		set {_new} to true
	else if vehicle of {_d} is not {_e}:
		delete entity within {_d}
		set {_new} to true

	if {_new} is false:
		if {-hpbar_key::%{_id}%} is {_key}:
			stop

	set {_ratio} to min({_hp} / {_max}, 1)
	set {_filled} to round({_ratio} * {@bar-length})
	if {_hp} > 0:
		if {_filled} < 1:
			set {_filled} to 1

	if {_ratio} > 0.6:
		set {_c} to "&a"
	else if {_ratio} > 0.3:
		set {_c} to "&e"
	else:
		set {_c} to "&c"

	set {_bar} to ""
	loop {@bar-length} times:
		if loop-number <= {_filled}:
			set {_bar} to "%{_bar}%%{_c}%█"
		else:
			set {_bar} to "%{_bar}%&8█"
	if "{@show-percent}" is "true":
		set {_bar} to "%{_bar}% &f%round({_ratio} * 100)%%%"

	if {_new} is true:
		# 청크 언로드 등으로 남아 있던 이 엔티티의 낡은 체력바 제거 (중복 방지)
		loop passengers of {_e}:
			set {_old} to loop-value
			if {_old} has scoreboard tag "hpbar":
				delete entity within {_old}
		if {_e} is a player:
			set {_h} to {@player-bar-height}
		else:
			set {_h} to {@mob-bar-height}
		spawn a text display at location of {_e}
		set {_d} to last spawned entity
		add "hpbar" to scoreboard tags of {_d}
		set billboard of {_d} to center
		set transformation translation of {_d} to vector(0, {_h}, 0)
		add {_d} to passengers of {_e}
		set {-hpbar_d::%{_id}%} to {_d}

	set text of {_d} to {_bar}
	set {-hpbar_key::%{_id}%} to {_key}

every {@check-interval}:
	loop all players:
		hpbar_show(loop-player)
		loop all living entities in radius {@mob-radius} around loop-player:
			set {_e} to loop-entity-2
			if {_e} is not a player:
				if {_e} is not an armor stand:
					hpbar_show({_e})

# 주인이 사라져 떠돌게 된 체력바 정리 (몹 사망, 디스폰 등)
every 2 seconds:
	loop all text displays:
		set {_t} to loop-entity
		if {_t} has scoreboard tag "hpbar":
			if vehicle of {_t} is not set:
				delete entity within {_t}

# 맞았을 때 데미지 숫자가 위로 떠올랐다가 사라짐
on damage:
	if "{@show-damage}" is "false":
		stop
	if event is cancelled:
		stop
	set {_v} to victim
	if {_v} is not a living entity:
		stop
	if {_v} is an armor stand:
		stop
	# 다른 스크립트/플러그인의 데미지 계산이 끝난 뒤 실제로 깎인 체력을 표시하기 위해 1틱 대기
	set {_before} to {_v}'s health
	wait 1 tick
	set {_after} to {_v}'s health
	set {_dmg} to round(({_before} - {_after}) * 10) / 10 *2
	if {_dmg} <= 0:
		stop
	set {_loc} to eye location of {_v} offset by vector(random number between -0.4 and 0.4, {@damage-height}, random number between -0.4 and 0.4)
	spawn a text display at {_loc}
	set {_t} to last spawned entity
	add "hpdmg" to scoreboard tags of {_t}
	set billboard of {_t} to center
	set text of {_t} to "&c-%{_dmg}%"
	set interpolation duration of {_t} to 16 ticks
	wait 2 ticks
	set transformation translation of {_t} to vector(0, 1, 0)
	wait 18 ticks
	delete entity within {_t}

on death:
	hpbar_remove("%uuid of victim%")

on quit:
	hpbar_remove("%uuid of player%")

on load:
	loop all text displays:
		set {_e} to loop-entity
		if {_e} has scoreboard tag "hpbar":
			delete entity within {_e}
		else if {_e} has scoreboard tag "hpdmg":
			delete entity within {_e}
	delete {-hpbar_d::*}
	delete {-hpbar_key::*}

on unload:
	loop {-hpbar_d::*}:
		set {_e} to loop-value
		delete entity within {_e}
	delete {-hpbar_d::*}
	delete {-hpbar_key::*}
